<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c48a9b9e-b666-4c79-8a44-08a23d094316> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Alternative> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c48a9b9e-b666-4c79-8a44-08a23d094316> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Lazy/deferred text export (mark-dirty, write on shutdown or on demand) instead of synchronous write-through — rejected: a user can capture then immediately git commit, and shutdown is unreliable (SIGKILL); at ~2k quads the synchronous export costs milliseconds, and always-in-sync store/text makes the startup three-way compare unambiguous." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/c48a9b9e-b666-4c79-8a44-08a23d094316> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
