<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Automatic capture is a telemetry journal, not a record minter" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/783a4b9e-8649-4154-a158-751bd1058e05> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Automatic (adapter-initiated) captures — the Claude Code Stop hook and the opencode session push — never write to the knowledge graph. POST /api/v1/capture appends a fire-log journal entry (host, summary, changed files) and mints nothing; no proposed record, no inbox entry. Deliberate capture remains the only minting path: record_important_decision and an agent explicitly invoking the MCP capture_decision_point tool. Evidence for the demotion: across the entire life of automatic capture (v2.2, 2026-07-13 → 2026-07-15) not one auto-minted record was ratified — every specimen was a status message (\"Blocked: …\", \"Waiting on the test suite…\", \"What would you like to clarify…\") because a session's final message is a report to the user, not a decision, and no symbolic guard can distinguish the two by timing alone. The maintainer's verdict: these are prompt/build statuses that do not belong in the graph at all. The trial arms never depended on auto-minting (their daemons predate v2.2), so nothing loses record accumulation. The fires journal keeps the auditable session breadcrumb (invariant #6) without polluting the graph; the [trial-fire] kill-metric tally reads labeled graph records, not the fires log, so telemetry entries cannot inflate it." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/e07a009a-9023-4688-95e6-123a1104913a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-15T16:52:15.837306Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Automatic capture is a telemetry journal, not a record minter" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/007dce15-98de-4494-8c64-1729d9e93d66> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3ccb78fb-648c-46d6-8b31-230ab0798c3b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Judgment + observation strata slice passes acceptance" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/11e01ea2-f520-4f7c-a165-09532dacd43f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/8d48edbd-7ee2-4a52-9eac-f2a09c858637> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/accf4f9f-6309-4d3f-8705-26e551824eb0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the judgment+observation strata slice (design ADs 8dd7da0c sidecar, 47620cf2 queue, a557bd33 confidence gate, 642b09ba scope/abstention, 0aa98fe1 silence amendment; Constraints 4879b25c proposed-never-gates, 162a5530 symbolic-only) meets its proposed acceptance criteria, verified on the real repo 2026-07-13. This slice has no spec §7 entry — these criteria are the recorded spec amendment. (1) Observation stratum: moosedev index writes churn.json (318 files, 24-month window) anchored to indexed_commit; non-git dirs degrade to a warning (regression-tested); meta schema stays 2, no substrate invalidated. (2) Full accounting: the live dry-run accounted for every debt-surface role-bearing entity — 88 role + 47 criticality judgments, 312 unclassified-with-reason, 1,655 excluded by kind as groups, 75 missing entities honestly flagged (minted, then 155 judgments applied) — with projected quad growth printed (~1,705, +8.9% on 19.2k). (3) Advisory-until-ratified: after apply, 155 nodes at proposed, zero playsRole/hasCriticality edges, validate_project 0 violations, and the gate on AppState (fan-in 506, the classifier's own top pick) returned ALLOW while the criticality-high judgment was merely proposed. (4) Never-nudge: pending_ratifications reports 25 (links+records only) with '155 judgment proposal(s) waiting quietly'; the LSP nudge count excludes all judgments (tested). (5) Ratification: accepting the AppState criticality judgment via the API materialized exactly one hasCriticality edge and flipped the gate to require_ratification citing 'criticality: high (ratified judgment)' with a gate-fire logged; accepting a core-algorithm role ticked /debt's additive core column to 0/1 (undocumented — honest). (6) Surfaces: the hover dossier renders '- criticality: high — ratified 2026-07-13 by moosedev-classifier', the '⚠ core entity — no linked rationale' hotspot line, and the observations digest 'churn: 14 commits/24mo · last 2026-07-12 · 1 author(s) · top 100%'; proposed judgments render as 'target? (proposed, conf, disposition)'; lens badges (glue?/critical) regression-tested via the raw LSP client. (7) Suites at acceptance: policy 10, proposals 4, classify 2 (+4 rule-table units), grounded_capture 6, debt 1, api 26, mcp_replies 3, lsp_diagnostics 15, both-hosts 1, lib 149, substrate 55+; clippy clean on all new files. Remaining manual step: Zed lens visual + workbench batch-triage click-through (group Accept-all/Reject-all) by the maintainer." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/00b04a90-f327-44d4-bff2-a019befb06a4> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
