<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/084a9873-0e0b-426e-bb1d-c439a2970928> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Grounded capture at a decision point (proposed; ratify or reject in the workbench inbox).\n\nFiles changed: .claude/hooks/moosedev-push.sh, .moosedev/kg.nq, ontologies/software-code.ttl, ontologies/software-code_shapes.ttl, src/api/handlers/debt.rs, src/api/handlers/proposals.rs, src/api/models.rs, src/api/routes.rs, src/code/substrate/mod.rs, src/code/substrate/producer.rs, src/code/substrate/resolver.rs, src/graph/debt.rs, src/graph/dossier.rs, src/graph/grounded_capture.rs, src/graph/mod.rs, src/graph/proposals.rs, src/graph/state.rs, src/lsp/mod.rs, src/main.rs, src/mcp/mod.rs." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
