<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/084a9873-0e0b-426e-bb1d-c439a2970928> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-13T23:34:44.600378Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
