<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1869e3a4-53cb-43a4-8db6-d82e8e8add5b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex-mcp-client" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1869e3a4-53cb-43a4-8db6-d82e8e8add5b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Generated artifact list summaries expose a search_text field containing each document's complete rendered Markdown, and the shared React artifact page performs a trimmed, case-insensitive substring filter over that text and list metadata. Artifact generation already materializes every document for list requests, so this keeps search instant and deterministic without per-record browser requests or a second retrieval subsystem. Selection remains based on the unfiltered list so narrowing the sidebar does not disrupt the open detail." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1869e3a4-53cb-43a4-8db6-d82e8e8add5b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
