<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1e260d23-634f-417c-bcb0-c4b043e0d4dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex-mcp-client" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/1e260d23-634f-417c-bcb0-c4b043e0d4dc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Workbench deep links use durable UUID identity and dispatch ArchitecturalDecision, Requirement, Lesson, and Constraint records to #/adrs/{uuid}, #/requirements/{uuid}, #/lessons/{uuid}, and #/constraints/{uuid}. Each typed artifact detail and the generic record detail render the same immediate incoming/outgoing object-property neighborhood with Cytoscape, sourced from GET /api/v1/records/{uuid}; clicking a neighboring typed record opens its list/detail interface and unsupported project kinds retain #/record/{uuid}. Constraints follow the generated-artifact service contract with deterministic list/detail Markdown, warnings, and ZIP export. Generated ordinals remain transient display/API identity. Typed artifact pages accept one additional record-detail request so relationship policy stays centralized rather than being duplicated across artifact APIs." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
