<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3b32fb25-1957-4f74-8d64-c70b250c8cae> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/272c2ce0-1715-42de-8450-9f78d021812d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3c3a6666-cfc9-4c57-a99a-d9e1cfed112f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3c3a6666-cfc9-4c57-a99a-d9e1cfed112f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "http.addr is a hint; consumers verify backend identity via /api/v1/health" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3c3a6666-cfc9-4c57-a99a-d9e1cfed112f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3c3a6666-cfc9-4c57-a99a-d9e1cfed112f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Layered model replacing file-presence trust. (1) File hygiene, best-effort: http.addr is invalidated at serve-mode entry BEFORE the long bootstrap (main.rs, right after ensure_no_live_backend), at the top of every HTTP startup path (spawn_http_if_enabled), when the axum serve task ends mid-run, and on clean shutdown; a successful bind rewrites it. (2) Identity, the actual guarantee: /api/v1/health now reports the backend's CANONICAL data_dir (daemons are often started with a relative ./.moosedev), and every cross-process consumer validates it before trusting the address — the generated gate/push/capture hooks preflight /api/v1/health with a 2s timeout and compare against `cd .moosedev && pwd -P`, silently failing open on any mismatch or error, so project payloads are never posted to a dead or reclaimed port; --status and `moosedev ui` route through runtime::verify_http_addr (reqwest, 2s timeout, canonical-path comparison). (3) In-process workbench-URL rendering never reads the file at all (AppState-published bound address, AD a97f14e9). Unchanged from the superseded decision: ephemeral 127.0.0.1:0 default, infallible spawn_http_if_enabled, --status socket-connect backend liveness (never opens RocksDB), localhost-only default, MOOSEDEV_HTTP_ADDR / MOOSEDEV_NO_HTTP dials. Note: hooks stay silent against daemons predating the canonical health field until the daemon restarts on the new binary — fail-open by design." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3c3a6666-cfc9-4c57-a99a-d9e1cfed112f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3c3a6666-cfc9-4c57-a99a-d9e1cfed112f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/2191efb1-edd2-43fb-829c-7e40100c0ae0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
