<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/3d2abe82-3228-4302-a610-7b3983c476f2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
