<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4d57fbad-f319-4a71-929f-191186e2ba1d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/a879e42c-ad22-4ca6-819d-a0803c6514a2> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
