<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4db59805-ebd6-4209-a564-de6a2656c354> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/72dc4260-2f0c-47d3-967e-44a981e0c248> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4f1d6b16-0963-403c-88b0-6a791dd2b1df> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4f1d6b16-0963-403c-88b0-6a791dd2b1df> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "didSave-debounced in-process substrate reindex" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4f1d6b16-0963-403c-88b0-6a791dd2b1df> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4f1d6b16-0963-403c-88b0-6a791dd2b1df> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/accf4f9f-6309-4d3f-8705-26e551824eb0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4f1d6b16-0963-403c-88b0-6a791dd2b1df> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4f1d6b16-0963-403c-88b0-6a791dd2b1df> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the daemon schedules a debounced background substrate rebuild when the Knowledge-LSP sees a qualifying textDocument/didSave, and `moosedev init` installs post-merge/post-checkout re-index hooks alongside post-commit — closing both staleness gaps behind wrong-line squiggles (uncommitted saved edits, Lesson aea51dbd; HEAD moves without a commit). Mechanism: a daemon-global ReindexScheduler (src/code/substrate/scheduler.rs — dedicated OS thread + mpsc, matching the sync-session idiom) with a trailing 15s quiet window, a 5-minute backstop anchored at the first unserviced save, structural single-flight with re-arm, and a 5-minute failure cooldown. handle_did_save posts a nudge through a boxed-callback slot on AppState (keeps the code layer free of graph deps); saves qualify only when the file extension belongs to a producer that detects the repo, plus a micro-guard skipping saves byte-identical to the doc's base_text. The runner calls producer::run_index IN-PROCESS, inheriting index.lock (the cross-process guard vs hook/manual runs, Lesson 75e182fb), atomic generation publish, and cleanup; delivery needs zero new wiring — the published manifest identity change flows through AppState::substrate() and each session's 2s tick republishes re-anchored diagnostics. Trailing-only debounce deliberately contrasts the leading+trailing kg.nq WriteThrottle (AD 282378cd): a ~49s whole-project rebuild must never fire on the leading edge. Refines AD 992f3f10: still no FS watcher — didSave is an editor signal, not filesystem watching. Enabled by default; env kill-switch MOOSEDEV_NO_REINDEX_ON_SAVE. Daemon shutdown never blocks on an in-flight run (abandoned unpublished generations are invisible and swept by the next successful run). init's three hooks share one reconciled ASYNC template (pgrep guard + nohup background run); the old synchronous commit-blocking template is upgraded in place when byte-identical, and the shipped template deliberately drops the dev-checkout ./target/release preference. Verified: 6 scheduler unit tests (debounce/backstop/single-flight/cooldown/shutdown), 3 LSP wiring tests including an end-to-end save→rebuild→republish acceptance test with a real scheduler over a real socket, init hook tests, full touched-surface suites green, clippy -D warnings clean." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/4f1d6b16-0963-403c-88b0-6a791dd2b1df> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
