<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/510c5585-6ff1-4ff1-abff-a7467adc5b71> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Load repo-root .env before resolving MOOSEDev runtime configuration" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/510c5585-6ff1-4ff1-abff-a7467adc5b71> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "codex-mcp-client" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/510c5585-6ff1-4ff1-abff-a7467adc5b71> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The moosedev binary now loads a repo-root .env at process startup before tracing setup, mode-specific config, MOOSEDEV_DATA_DIR, socket resolution, and autospawn. dotenv values only fill missing environment variables; explicit shell or MCP-client environment values retain precedence. This lets --connect proxies and their detached auto-spawned --serve backend share configuration such as MOOSEDEV_DATA_DIR, MOOSEDEV_ONTOLOGY_DIR, and LLM settings without requiring the start script." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/510c5585-6ff1-4ff1-abff-a7467adc5b71> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/510c5585-6ff1-4ff1-abff-a7467adc5b71> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-18T14:14:46.993364Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/510c5585-6ff1-4ff1-abff-a7467adc5b71> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Load repo-root .env before resolving MOOSEDev runtime configuration" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "MOOSEDev v2 spec of record: four-phase delivery, Zed-first" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/402e5c0b-dc22-4063-84c6-6b9dd954d540> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: spec/MOOSEDev_v2_spec.md (v0.1, 2026-07-06) is the spec of record for the full v2 scope — code layer, active-agency layer, and knowledge-LSP in ONE document — delivered in four phases with hard per-phase acceptance criteria: v2.0 read-only vertical slice (substrate + skeleton + resolver + dossier + LSP hover/diagnostics on Zed), v2.1 ambient layer + why-coverage debt metric + ratification inbox + citation-seed migration, v2.2 active agency (policy engine, entity-exact push, gate on two hosts, grounded capture), v2.3 write-path code actions + Neovim conformance. Client order: Zed first (extension-less per AD 2501ffa4), Neovim as scriptable conformance client at v2.3, VS Code picture-frame post-v2. LSP transport: a `moosedev lsp` stdio shim to the shared backend's Unix socket, reusing the proven --connect proxy pattern (src/runtime.rs). One dossier query function (get_entity_dossier) serves LSP hover, MCP push, and HTTP — the no-second-brain constraint (2ba76439) enforced by construction, not by synchronization. Delivery gate: role badges (v2.1) require the role-taxonomy AD b5b4762b ratified first. User-confirmed scope choice 2026-07-06." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-07T04:49:33.206505Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "MOOSEDev v2 spec of record: four-phase delivery, Zed-first" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/350c7f2e-61bd-49e4-b7cd-2fdd3f51f521> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/3dd3544c-eb46-4f7a-8764-b0a44813e1b4> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/20807076-c205-4cbb-9bf0-487596f36915> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52554569-be1b-4ac0-ad84-0437a758a6b2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/b7fd737c-fc3f-4043-8673-403c8897708f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Densify the graph by GROWL reasoning, not capture" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Materialize entailed A-box edges DETERMINISTICALLY by running GROWL (Trivyn's 97%-coverage OWL 2 RL reasoner) in --enrich mode over the project KG + ontology axioms, rather than asking the capture agent to hand-draw inverses (unreliable + confabulation-adjacent). --enrich does property/subclass propagation — prp-inv (inverses), prp-trp (transitive), prp-spo2 (property chains), prp-spo1 (subPropertyOf), prp-dom/rng — and deliberately skips sameAs (no quadratic blowup; A-box record identity isn't a sameAs problem). Symbolic-pure (invariant #1), no confabulation (only entailments). PROVENANCE: GROWL is sound (\"every output links to a delta triple\") but exposes no per-triple justification API, so materialize into a SEPARATE \"inferred\" named graph — distinguishable from asserted, re-derivable by drop-and-rerun. Complements the capture-workflow fix (base edges): GROWL amplifies base edges, it can't conjure them." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-06-21T23:48:58.183525Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Densify the graph by GROWL reasoning, not capture" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Constraint/72d7a908-30da-431f-b914-731b77996666> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52a6b6cc-cbf0-4b09-ba16-ec3c4f6c90b8> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/b3ba8285-746d-4f3e-a092-b8e4fc324149> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52bb172b-2395-4db5-af14-8166fe313679> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52bb172b-2395-4db5-af14-8166fe313679> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Stale-rationale Hint approximated by file-level git history in v2.0" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52bb172b-2395-4db5-af14-8166fe313679> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/bf05b460-166a-4e43-b5d9-be2d5df42320> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52bb172b-2395-4db5-af14-8166fe313679> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52bb172b-2395-4db5-af14-8166fe313679> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52bb172b-2395-4db5-af14-8166fe313679> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The v2.0 stale-rationale diagnostic fires when an entity's newest linked record timestamp predates the last commit touching the entity's defining file (git log -1 --format=%cI per didOpen/didSave, both sides parsed to instants - never string-compared across timezone offsets). Message wording is scoped honestly to the approximation: \"rationale predates later changes to this file\", not per-entity claims. The spec's ideal input - per-entity change counts - is v2.1 observations-stratum data; when that lands, the Hint upgrades to true per-entity churn without changing the diagnostic surface. At most one Hint per entity, severity Hint, individually disableable. First live run caught real drift: the symbol-normalization Constraint (recorded 2026-07-07) predates later commits to symbols.rs." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/52bb172b-2395-4db5-af14-8166fe313679> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
