<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/5dfe9a84-38fa-4a66-8e00-e715e0309e90> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "didSave-debounced reindex with unconditional qualifying-save nudge" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/5dfe9a84-38fa-4a66-8e00-e715e0309e90> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
