<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6255d815-cfb7-412d-9450-1bc9cfe5fa2a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/34b00cc0-1a3d-4367-bd9f-d9664064eb58> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6255d815-cfb7-412d-9450-1bc9cfe5fa2a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/dcb61401-d7c0-4165-9133-2bf9a67774ca> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6255d815-cfb7-412d-9450-1bc9cfe5fa2a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/3cdad2a7-5557-489e-b5f9-192c1e6bdf5d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6255d815-cfb7-412d-9450-1bc9cfe5fa2a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/4886b1af-735d-4086-8c9e-195d611c8b70> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Trial surface moves to moosedev 0.7.0; soak gate lifted for month-2" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The trivyn-trial and moose-trial daemons (and the installed moosedev on this system) move to 0.7.0; month-2 onward runs single-regime on it. 0.7.0 carries the improved system prompts, tool instructions, and the re-architected MOOSE underneath (NLP modernization, LLM-assist refactor — moose PRs #47–#51), all plausibly relevant to trial recall quality.\n\nMISS-AUDIT EVIDENCE (2026-07-24, all 57 July moose [trial-miss] events read from kg.nq): the hypothesized mechanism \"NLQ query failed and the agent did not fall back to get_relevant_context\" is NOT what the log shows — exactly 1/57 mentions an NLQ-tool failure. Dominant modes: (a) genuine content gaps — whys/plans re-derived from code because the graph did not hold them, concentrated in the re-architecture phases (new territory; live-capture opportunities); (b) strict-rule misses — recall consulted but returned only facts already present in the prompt/open files (no non-local assist ⇒ not a fire, per protocol AD 07415633); ~8 explicitly the latter. Most recall consultations were get_relevant_context keyword-topic probes, not NLQ query calls. IMPLICATION for month-2: 0.7.0's better NLQ/prompts may still cut misses (deeper relationship reasoning reaching what shallow lexical probes missed), but the bigger lever is capturing the re-architecture's decisions now.\n\nMEASUREMENT DISCIPLINE: the upgrade changes agent-facing tool instructions AND capture surface AND recall quality at once — month-2 deltas in the fire/miss tally and probe gaps conflate product improvement with decay dynamics. Disentangling instruments already in place: per-row trial_epoch stamps (Lesson e209a0d9), and the pre-registered moose B0-decay prediction (Lesson 2f00e722). Frozen instruments (probes, golds, judge, kill thresholds — Constraint 75b0cf14) unchanged." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/60e567d7-87fd-4a08-b9a6-9d8c7b4f96fd> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-24T17:35:18.676297Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Trial surface moves to moosedev 0.7.0; soak gate lifted for month-2" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/62b3d043-f803-4421-b7b3-3a4dc664029c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#supersedes> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6420250b-a84a-4eb5-94c0-fe1c2bb5b79b> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6420250b-a84a-4eb5-94c0-fe1c2bb5b79b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6420250b-a84a-4eb5-94c0-fe1c2bb5b79b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Soak journal-only capture on moosedev before upgrading trial daemons" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6420250b-a84a-4eb5-94c0-fe1c2bb5b79b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6420250b-a84a-4eb5-94c0-fe1c2bb5b79b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The trivyn-trial and moose-trial daemons stay on their current pre-v2.2 binaries until the journal-only automatic capture (AD 007dce15) has soaked on moosedev's own dogfood instance. Rationale: the v2.x line produced an explosion of wacky auto-minted ADRs on moosedev (0% ratification, cleaned up 2026-07-15), and the maintainer wants observed-quiet operation before exposing the trial projects to the 2.x surface. The trial daemons were never at risk of the noise (no capture surface pre-v2.2), so there is no urgency; when the upgrade happens, bench trial_epoch fingerprinting (daemon version + binary sha256 per run row) records the transition without touching frozen instruments (probes, golds, judge, kill thresholds — Constraint 75b0cf14)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6420250b-a84a-4eb5-94c0-fe1c2bb5b79b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "superseded" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6420250b-a84a-4eb5-94c0-fe1c2bb5b79b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-15T17:50:28.529429Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
