<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/6d44e54a-8e14-4902-be8a-ef9c265f082b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/1d7b26e6-2e72-4b62-ad95-25dca5f3480f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
