<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a557bd33-77d6-43fc-bf42-bfe8e53892cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/8d48edbd-7ee2-4a52-9eac-f2a09c858637> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a557bd33-77d6-43fc-bf42-bfe8e53892cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a557bd33-77d6-43fc-bf42-bfe8e53892cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the confidence gate routes classifier judgments as escalated ⇔ confidence < 0.6 ∨ high-stakes, where high-stakes = the entity carries an accepted constrains link ∨ the classifier proposes criticality high — but NO judgment proposal, escalated or auto-held, ever counts toward pending_count (the LSP nudge and MCP pending_ratifications count only links + records, i.e. human-authored things awaiting review; pending_ratifications tallies waiting judgments in a separate quiet note). Escalation is inbox PROMINENCE: escalated groups sort first and are flagged in the workbench, where judgments are grouped by rule with group-level Accept-all/Reject-all (a ~350-judgment backfill becomes a handful of decisions, triaged at leisure). Ratification is load-bearing in exactly one place: the GATE — badges and the observations digest work from proposed immediately (advisory, visually distinct per §5.3), but a machine guess may start blocking edits (ratified criticality-high → RequireRatification, citing the accepted judgment node) only after a human signs it; proposed judgments structurally cannot gate (no edge exists). This realizes Consequence be097082 and consciously amends its letter (auto-held-only silence) to never-nudge — sanctioned by James 2026-07-13 during slice planning: a machine's classification backlog must not page a human." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/a557bd33-77d6-43fc-bf42-bfe8e53892cb> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
