<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "v2.3 write path + conformance passes acceptance — v2 complete" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/11e01ea2-f520-4f7c-a165-09532dacd43f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "opencode-moosedev" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the v2.3 slice (design AD fb61ce61; deferral amendment d0925fc7) meets the spec §7 v2.3 acceptance criteria, verified on the real artifact 2026-07-14 — completing all four v2 phases (spec AD 52554569). (1) A code-action proposal round-trips editor → ratification queue → workbench ratify → visible in the next hover: proven end-to-end in tests/lsp_write_path.rs (codeAction on a fixture entity → executeCommand files the proposal → accept_proposal simulates the workbench → the very next hover renders the record; judgments round-trip the same way with author editor:neovim), and live on this repo — a raw LSP client took the real lightbulb menu at graph::proposals::propose_link (whose top-ranked candidate was AD 20a15361, the ratification-queue decision that genuinely governs that function), filed ProposedLink aa68c5e2 via workspace/executeCommand, repeat returned the same IRI (idempotent), and the proposal appeared humanized in the workbench inbox awaiting human ratification. (2) The Neovim scripted conformance suite passes on a real editor: clients/nvim/conformance.sh ran headless Neovim 0.12.4 (vim.lsp.start + buf_request_sync) against a scratch copy of this repo (git archive + derived caches; the scratch daemon hydrates from kg.nq so the write-path round-trip never pollutes the real graph) — capabilities (hover/codeLens/codeAction/executeCommand/diagnosticProvider), hover dossier markdown, code lens, pull diagnostics full report, codeAction menu, executeCommand round-trip + idempotency, and InvalidParams on malformed arguments: PASS. clients/nvim/moosedev.lua is the plain lspconfig entry spec §5.7 requires. (3) Grep-proof: grep -nE (link_code|relate\\(|accept_proposal|reject_proposal|ensure_entity|record_instance|store.insert|txn.insert|start_transaction|mint_) over src/lsp/ returns nothing — the only graph writes reachable from the LSP are propose_link/propose_judgment queue submissions — and tests/lsp_write_path.rs makes the criterion executable via a source-scan test (denylist + required-allowlist). Also delivered: pull diagnostics (textDocument/diagnostic, LSP 3.17) returning the same items the push path publishes (parity test), and the propose_judgment pending-twin dedup guard. Full suite green at acceptance; cargo fmt clean; graph validates 0 violations." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-14T08:06:34.409022Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
