<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b73db672-cefe-4344-8a55-ccbec659c88e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/350c7f2e-61bd-49e4-b7cd-2fdd3f51f521> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "v2.1 ambient layer + debt metric passes acceptance (role-independent)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/8d48edbd-7ee2-4a52-9eac-f2a09c858637> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/accf4f9f-6309-4d3f-8705-26e551824eb0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "James" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the v2.1 slice — ambient code lens + why-coverage debt metric + ratification inbox + pending nudge + citation-seed migration, role-independent per AD 2ba69b1b — passes its spec §7 acceptance, verified on the artifact and across every live surface (2026-07-12). Evidence against the three criteria: (1) why-coverage queryable per component — GET /api/v1/debt returns real per-component coverage on the moosedev repo, auditable via each component's undocumented[]; unit + synthetic-integration + axum HTTP tests green; proposed links provably do NOT inflate it (the D1/D2 interlock, confirmed live: a pending socket_path_for proposal left the MCP-runtime component at 0/96, and accepting it ticks the numerator). (2) lens only on knowledge-bearing / hotspot entities — the live Knowledge-LSP emits 8 correct lenses for src/lsp/mod.rs (record-count badges like \"1 decision\" on run_session + \"no linked rationale\" hotspots on undocumented public entities, at correct positions), confirmed rendering in Zed after enabling code_lens; NO role badges (deferred to v2.2 with its classifier). (3) migration accounts for every seed — the citation-seed migration reported all 62 seed-records (3 proposals + 166 explained skips, zero silent drops) and enqueued 3 proposed links, ratified through the workbench Ratifications page. Also verified live: the pending_ratifications MCP tool (returns the 3), the workbench Debt heatmap and Ratifications inbox (accept/reject works). Two bugs surfaced + fixed during verification, captured as Lessons: stale-index LSP mispositioning from uncommitted edits (aea51dbd) and Zed code_lens off-by-default now enabled by moosedev init (0ecd530f). Realizes the four-phase delivery AD 52554569; unblocks v2.2 (active agency + the judgment stratum)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-13T06:46:25.431484Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "v2.1 ambient layer + debt metric passes acceptance (role-independent)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b7f38186-fc03-4fde-a394-c0eb123258e2> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/350c7f2e-61bd-49e4-b7cd-2fdd3f51f521> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b933bd10-de56-4481-91dd-397a192a8022> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b933bd10-de56-4481-91dd-397a192a8022> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "get_relevant_context seeds with hybrid BM25F⊕dense retrieval" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b933bd10-de56-4481-91dd-397a192a8022> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/11e01ea2-f520-4f7c-a165-09532dacd43f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b933bd10-de56-4481-91dd-397a192a8022> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/b933bd10-de56-4481-91dd-397a192a8022> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Evolves the BM25-only seed (AD 6fd4f0e5) into core's search_records_hybrid: BM25F (rdfs:label 2x + hasDescription) fused with dense cosine over the instance vector store via Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RECORD_RRF_K=60). The seed gates the whole typed expansion, so improving seed recall is the highest-leverage fix for comprehension debt — a concept named differently than the query (\"flaky tests\" vs a query for \"intermittent CI failures\") was previously unreachable along with its entire linked neighborhood. Pipeline in relevant_context (src/graph/mod.rs): (1) symbolic-first anchoring — an exact normalized rdfs:label/hasTitle match seeds the named record first (invariant #1); (2) the hybrid seed recovers paraphrases BM25 misses; (3) the bounded typed expansion (Constraint aa8b3fa3) keeps its budgets, but candidate neighbors are now RANKED by typed-edge priority (isMotivatedBy/violates/supersedes/constrains/dependsOn over generic edges) then dense topic-similarity before the EXPAND_MAX cap, so the surviving links are answer-completing rather than store-iteration order; (4) the dense channel's confidence floor (DEFAULT_DENSE_FLOOR=0.5; MOOSEDEV_DENSE_FLOOR) preserves honest-empty-state (#6); (5) write-time index_record plus a durable, incrementally-reconciled instance index (instance-vectors.db) keep dense coherent, with warm-restart embedding cost ~0. Soft-fails to pure BM25 when no embedding backbone is present or the index is empty. Core consumed: search_records_hybrid, InstanceVecStore (+ new contains), embed_and_index_instance, retrieval_embed_query/_document, HybridMatch diagnostics. Validated: a \"how do we ship updates without taking the service offline\" query recovered the blue-green record PURELY via dense (BM25 returned nothing; cosine 0.575, above the 0.5 floor); in-domain paraphrases scored 0.575–0.730 vs an unrelated query < 0.5 (returns empty); MOOSEDEV_DENSE_FLOOR=0.99 collapses output to BM25-only (dense adds, never distorts); warm restart re-embeds 0; full cargo test suite + clippy green. Governed by the narrowed A-box-seed Constraint (which supersedes 71637748); respects bounded expansion (aa8b3fa3). Evolves AD 6fd4f0e5, left standing as BM25-seed history." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
