<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/c20ccbe5-99a7-432b-ab60-b02aef193b8c> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Blocked: the **moose engine is mid-edit again** (`~/code/moose` — `apply_overlay` in `vocabulary.rs` grew two parameters and a tuple return, but `pipeline/mod.rs:5155` still calls the old 3-arg form). Same pattern as the previous two times — your parallel session is presumably in the middle of it. I\n\nGrounded capture at a decision point (proposed; ratify or reject in the workbench inbox).\n\nFiles changed: .claude/hooks/moosedev-capture.sh, .moosedev/kg.nq, Cargo.lock, Cargo.toml, clients/nvim/README.md, clients/nvim/conformance.lua, clients/nvim/conformance.sh, clients/nvim/moosedev.lua, src/api/handlers/proposals.rs, src/api/models.rs, src/graph/context.rs, src/graph/grounded_capture.rs, src/graph/lifecycle.rs, src/graph/proposals.rs, src/lsp/mod.rs, src/mcp/mod.rs, tests/context.rs, tests/grounded_capture.rs, tests/lsp_code_actions.rs, tests/lsp_diagnostics.rs." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
