<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/cd151077-d38e-49fa-923f-ce52d7608db7> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Waiting on the test suite — I'll continue with the commit partition (working-set discipline → ADR memo → v2.3 → capture abstention → chore/bench → kg.nq) as soon as it reports green.\n\nGrounded capture at a decision point (proposed; ratify or reject in the workbench inbox).\n\nFiles changed: .claude/hooks/moosedev-capture.sh, .opencode/plugins/moosedev-push.ts, Cargo.lock, Cargo.toml, bench/judge_recovery.py, bench/run.py, bench/run_trial_month.sh, bench/trial_report.py, clients/nvim/README.md, clients/nvim/conformance.lua, clients/nvim/conformance.sh, clients/nvim/moosedev.lua, src/adrs.rs, src/api/handlers/adrs.rs, src/api/handlers/policy.rs, src/api/handlers/proposals.rs, src/api/models.rs, src/graph/context.rs, src/graph/dossier.rs, src/graph/grounded_capture.rs." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
