<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "v2.3 spec amendment: Record-constraint and Mark-rationale-stale code actions deferred" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/6baa075c-db0d-48e0-800a-0cae86603b2a> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: of spec §5.6's four editor code actions, v2.3 ships the three that fit the ratification queue cleanly — \"Link decision to this entity…\" (suggested candidates), \"Propose role: <r>\", \"Propose criticality: high|low\" — and DEFERS \"Record constraint…\" and \"Mark rationale stale\" past v2.3 (user-sanctioned 2026-07-13). Why: both are blocked on a workbench compose/edit surface, not on the queue. \"Record constraint…\" needs free text, and a bare LSP session has no input surface (the session deliberately has no server→client request plumbing — client responses are dropped at the read loop — and the workbench has no record-compose form). \"Mark rationale stale\" additionally lacks a persisted review mechanism: staleness today is a COMPUTED hint (newest linked record predates the file's last commit) that self-heals when the record is updated or superseded; a persisted human flag is a new workflow concept needing clearing semantics — it cannot ride hasLifecycleStatus (a record can be accepted AND need review), and without a clearing story the flag itself rots, the exact comprehension-debt failure mode MOOSEDev exists to fight. The ontology edit itself is trivial (~10 lines TTL + a shapes branch) — the missing piece is review-workflow design, so the honest version is its own follow-up slice alongside a compose surface." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-14T07:31:16.96279Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "v2.3 spec amendment: Record-constraint and Mark-rationale-stale code actions deferred" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/306e9609-93bc-4d96-8d2c-5b8e17ccf19d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d0925fc7-13f2-4368-9014-64059dc4343a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#weighs> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/7a67468f-892f-4775-bd92-37b91a8a4404> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Substrate storage: raw SCIP index + meta.json, parsed in-memory" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/a83c153a-32cb-4124-9f25-2334b5c06fe8> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/accf4f9f-6309-4d3f-8705-26e551824eb0> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: the substrate persists exactly the producer's raw output (.moosedev/substrate/index.scip) plus a small meta.json (schema_version, indexed_commit, indexed_at, producer, producer_version, mode, counts), and parses the index into memory on load — no database projection. Why: the moosedev repo index is 3.86 MB / 84 documents / 42,234 occurrences and parses in tens of milliseconds, so a persistent query layer buys nothing; keeping the producer artifact canonical means zero format drift between what rust-analyzer emitted and what the resolver serves. Write protocol: emit to index.scip.tmp, parse+validate, fs::rename into place, write meta.json LAST — meta presence signals a complete substrate. Staleness: meta.indexed_commit vs `git rev-parse HEAD`, baked into every Resolution. The in-memory model (producer-agnostic per-file occurrence tables) is the tree-sitter seam: ResolutionMode { Scip, TreeSitter } exists now, only Scip is constructed. Implemented 2026-07-07 (v2.0 slice 1, commit 8019c5a)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-07T19:19:22.80864Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Substrate storage: raw SCIP index + meta.json, parsed in-memory" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isMotivatedBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/350c7f2e-61bd-49e4-b7cd-2fdd3f51f521> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d13be5bb-55b0-4ecc-a2c2-78f0ede8f502> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2511863f-082d-4861-bf83-9030d08b0067> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
