<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/d699f118-f608-4840-93de-81f434bbf97b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#resultsIn> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/fbb22a00-23c3-4e69-9984-2b9698ad5ac9> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
