<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/faba413e-6180-455c-a26a-8c3db9850adc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#ArchitecturalDecision> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/faba413e-6180-455c-a26a-8c3db9850adc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Inline cluster capture via flat alternatives/consequences fields" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/faba413e-6180-455c-a26a-8c3db9850adc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/CodeEntity/03bde047-5ec0-4838-9b93-f544fcf93b34> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/faba413e-6180-455c-a26a-8c3db9850adc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#concerns> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/SystemComponent/11e01ea2-f520-4f7c-a165-09532dacd43f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
