<https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/fd89fa33-0a65-49de-8d34-105b0ab9a7ea> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The Knowledge-LSP negotiates UTF-8 when offered and converts UTF-16 columns as before, but editor-facing positions are now relative to the active buffer, not blindly to the saved file. Each open document retains the saved/indexed baseline and the latest full-sync buffer text; a bounded deterministic line diff maps only byte-identical lines in both directions for diagnostics, code lenses, hover, and code actions. Insertions/deletions therefore shift stable anchors exactly. If the declaration line itself changed or a rewrite exceeds the bound, the surface stays silent instead of guessing. A substrate generation swap resets the baseline from disk while preserving later unsaved edits." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
