<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/05be1f6f-2e54-4422-87d7-536a40d97f32> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Claim: a newly loaded substrate generation is never rebased from mutable disk text merely because the file exists. The LSP accepts base_text only when indexed_started_at plus a stable stat/read/stat proves that the file predates and remained unchanged through the producer run; otherwise the document is unaligned and diagnostics, hover, code lenses, and code actions stay silent until a later generation provides a trustworthy baseline. The previous mixed-generation window is eliminated rather than accepted as eventually consistent." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
