<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/ea6c568d-ef9b-4c43-b091-8bf24ef28a86> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-07-17T04:09:16.711518Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
