<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Requirement/56e50b1f-1028-4efb-8339-20008d628d3d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The workbench must treat Constraints as a first-class generated artifact alongside ADRs, Requirements, and Lessons, with durable UUID deep links that open the Constraint list/detail interface. Detail views for typed artifacts and generic records must show a one-hop Cytoscape graph of immediate incoming and outgoing object-property connections above the record content. Clicking a neighboring project record must open its typed list/detail interface when supported and otherwise use the generic record route." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
